The captured-qr.f routines dqrdcx and dqrslx are modified and trimmed
versions of LINPACK dqrdc and dqrsl, version dated 08/14/78, by
G. W. Stewart, University of Maryland, Argonne National Lab. The sources
are src/appl/dqrdc.f and src/appl/dqrsl.f at R-devel revision 90840.
Don Yin retained the unpivoted QR and Q*y paths and captured their scalar
operations without changing BLAS order. R's doc/COPYRIGHTS states:
"The status of the included LINPACK routines is unclear: they are said to
be in the public domain in the USA." No broader public-domain claim is
made here. These adaptations are distributed with this GPL package.

